  "native_rules": [
    "Combo4 merges at the moving item cell, hides/detaches its rocket partner, assigns a typed strategy and uses moveType8/finishType9.",
    "Initial orientation comes from the partner. Native target discovery before shuffle alternates horizontal0/tiled30 and vertical1/tiled20. Additional targets keep the alternation; removing targets removes their id mapping.",
    "Actual rays recycle selected match views without match explosions, create lightball-flagged rocket models, register current/target mediation, bind explosion lifetime and play the original creation animation/shake/background.",
    "The original rocket replaces the lightball after ray collection stops. Its background does not shake the partner, unlike the TNT strategy.",
    "After all rays complete, one trigger15 value is created and replacements sort by native TopLeftHorizontalSorter: Ydescending/Xascending, with zero comparison for null/missing-current models.",
    "Each live/current replacement triggers then waits0.15 gameplay seconds; ordinary native rocket chain hits can explode later replacements first, so already-cleared models are skipped.",
    "Original ray transport, model/view pools, rocket row/column damage, flight parts, fall/cross-fall freezes and operation owners remain in use.",
    "Object pools grow with native Instantiate-on-empty behavior. Completion checks the real spawned-set count, rather than assuming the returned stack must equal its initial prewarm size.",
    "Native LightballSpecialStrategy ownership is shared by TNT and rocket variants. TNT retains its original simultaneous trigger15 after0.5 gameplay seconds, verified in the same14operation run."
  ],
